**Problem 2**

A client retries with exponential backoff: it waits 200 ms before retry 1, and the wait doubles each time, capped at 5 s. There is no jitter. How long has the client waited in total by the time it makes retry 6?

<solution>The waits are 200, 400, 800, 1,600 and 3,200 ms, then 6,400 ms capped to 5,000 ms. Total 11,200 ms = 11.2 s.</solution>
<check lang="python">
